Root cause:
The bug was caused by incorrect initialization of the log format variables `tag_max` and `pid_max` in the `__do_send_log()` function, which were not properly set to the lengths of the syslog tag and pid strings when using "short" and "raw" log formats. This oversight led to the wrong log format being used, resulting in potential log message formatting issues. The patch corrects this by ensuring that these variables are initialized to 0 and updated correctly based on the provided lengths before being used in the log message formatting.
